<title>TURKEY: Turkish anti-Islamists wins confidence vote.</title>
<headline>Turkish anti-Islamists wins confidence vote.</headline>
<dateline>ANKARA 1997-07-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Turkish Prime Minister Mesut Yilmaz's anti-Islamist government won a confidence vote in parliament on Saturday, according to unofficial voting figures.</p>
</text>
